<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id">Ṭahhla</book>
  <para style="h">Ṭahhla</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṭahhla</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ṭahhla</para>
  <para style="mt">Ṭahhla</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem cu lungleng in a um, Mi phuntling an rak umnak khawpi cu! Leilung pumpi i an rak upatmi khawpi cu nuhmei vekah a cang zo! Lalnu vek a rak si mi khawlian cu, Salkaihmi ah a cang zo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zan khawvarte a ṭap thluahthlo maw; Mitthli a biang parah luang vivo maw! A rualpi zohman an um ta lo, A hneemtu ah pakhatte hman an um lo. A rak ṭantu pawl in an zuarthlai, Mi hmuah in atu ahcun an dodal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah mipawl sal ah an cang, Hnaṭuan khung an ṭuan, Bawmtu nei loin; An hruaihlo hai an run inn ihsin; Miphun dang ram ah an um, Kan ta ti ding ram nei loin! Ral pawl in an kulh ṭheh hai, Luatnak lamzin nei loin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zion lamzin riahsia in a um, Zohman in an zawh nawn lo, Colh ni Pathian bia dingah. Hla saktu fala pawl harsatnak an tuar, Puithiam pawl an hruum an ai. Zion cu thinlung naa in a tuar, Khawpi kotka pawl an ṭhing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ral pawl an hlawh a tling, An kut sungah an huum. Bawipa amah in a tuarter, A sualnak a tamtuk ruangah. A faate pawl kaih ṭheh an si, Lam hlapi ah hruaihlo an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jerusalem ih sunlawinak cu, A cem zomi thil a si. An ṭawnṭai zet a hotu pawl cu, Rawl loih derdaimi zukneng vek an si; Thazaang zianghman an nei lo, Sakah thiam hmai ihsin an tlan tikah cun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem cu khawrop ah a cang, lungleng za in; A rak sunlawi zia a vun ciing sal ṭheu. A ral pawl ih kut sungah a thleng, Zohman bawmtu nei loin. A nehtu pawl cun an hnihsan, An hmuhsuam ciamco, a siatral tikah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmaizah tlak a sinak cu a cem zo, A taklawng in a um ih an hmuhsuam. A ningna in a ṭap a ai, A ningzak in a hmai a hup. A mahte a borhhlawh awter, Jerusalem in ṭihnungza sualnak a tuah zo ruangah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thianfai lonak cu a hni ah a lang; A hmailam thu cu a ruat dah lem lo. A siatnak cu ṭihnung za a si; Zohman in an hneem thei lo. A ral pawl in an neh zo; Zaangfah dil in Bawipa a ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ral pawl in a thil an long ṭheh, A sumsaw hmuahhmuah tla cu! A mit rori in a hmu hai, Biakinn sung an luh lai cu. Zentail mipawl lut lo dingah, Bawipa ih a khammi hmun ahcun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A minung pawl an hrum an ai; Ei ding pakhatkhat an hmuh tikah cun. An hlawnthil cu rawl ah an thleng, An pumpi nunnak dingah cun. “ Bawipa , i run zoh aw,” tiah an khawpi cu a au; “Ka harsat zia i run hmu aw!” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“I zohhnik uh,” tiah a au, A kiangih a fehtu hmuahhmuah hnenah cun. “Zohman in natnak an tuar dah lo, Kei ka tuarmi natnak tluk cun; Bawipa ih i pekmi natnak a si, Ka parih a thinheng tikah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tlunlam ihsin meisa a run thlak, Ka ruh sungih a alh-mi meisa cu. Keimah awk dingah thang a kam ih, Leilung ah i tlukter. Cuticun i tlansanta ih, Cat loin natnak i tuarter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ka sualnak hmuahhmuah cazin sungah a khum; A zatein hmunkhat ah a ṭem ih Ka hngawng ah i thlaih; A rit tukih i delh ciamco, Thazaang ka nei nawn lo. Bawipa in ka ral kut sungah i thlenter; Ka hrangah an cak tuk ih ka caang thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“ Bawipa ih hnihsanmi ah an cang, Ka ralkap cak bik pawl cu; A ralkap bur khat a kuat, Ka tlangval pawl that dingah. Sabit bangin ka minung pawl a rial hai, Judah fala note cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Curuangah a si kei ka ṭap, Ka mitthli rialti bangin a luang. Hnemtu zohman ka nei lo, Tha thotertu zohman an um lo. Ka ral in in neh ngah zo; Ka minung pawl zianghman an nei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Bomnak duh ah ka ban ka pharh, Asinain zohman in in bawm lo. Bawipa in ral pawl a ko, Khawzakip in in fuuk. An lakah zianghman ka si lo, Fihnungza thil men ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Asinain Bawipa cu a dik, A thu eltu ka rak si zo ruangah. Maw miphun pawl, i ngaihnik uh; Ka tuarzia hi zohhnik uh. Ka leeng le val pawl an hlo zo, Salkaihnak hmun ram hlapi ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“I rak ṭantu pawl ka ko, Asinain in bawm duh lo. Puithiam le hotu pawl an thi, Khawpi sung lamzin tluan ah. An pumpi nun duh ih, Rawl an hawlnak ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Maw Bawipa , ka vansaanzia hi i zohhnik; Ka nunnak a tuarzia hi. Ka thin a na ih ka lung a kuai, Ka lo dodal sualnak ruangah. Lamzin parah thah awknak a um, Inn sung khalah thihnak a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ka aihramnak i ngai sak aw, I hneemtu zohman an um si lo. Ka ral pawl an di a riam, Ka parih siatralnak na thlenter ruangah. Na tiamcia ni cu thlenter zaang aw, Ka tuar vekin ka ral pawl tuar ve hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“An tuahmi hmuahhmuah na hmaiah lang ṭheh seh; An ṭhatlonak hmuahhmuah tla hi! Annih cu hrem hai aw, Ka sualnak ruangih i hrem zo vekin. Vansanglam in ka aihram, Ka thin a pit a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Zion cu thimnak in a khuh; Bawipa a thin a heng ruangah. Israel ih sunlawinak cu, Van ihsin lei ah a run thlak; A Biakinn pi hman a dungtun, A thinheng ni ahcun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah ram khawte hmuahhmuah a siatsuah ṭheh, Zawnruahnak zianghman um loin. An ralhruang pawl a balsak ṭheh, An ram hum in an ṭannak ruhkulh pawl cu. Ningzah mualphonak a thlenter, An uknak le uktu pawl parah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel cahnak a sattan ṭheh, A thin-ai a thawh tikah cun. A pharh cia a baan a zuuk sal, Ral pawl ih in ra do tikah cun. Meisa alh bangin kan parah a hlio ciamco, Ziang hmuahhmuah a siatsuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A conkiang in kanmah in bat, Ral pawl ih in bah vekin. Amah in a that ṭheh hai, Kan hmai in hngaltertu hmuahhmuah cu. Hi Jerusalem khawpi sungah hin, A thinhengnak mei alh bangin kan tuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel a tisiat ṭheh zo, An do ral lian bangin. Hnawmpen ah a cangter ṭheh zo, An ruhkulh le an siangpahrang inn pawl cu. Cem neilo riahsiatnak a thlenter zo, Judah misenpi parah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sop seksek in a deengkuai theh, Amah kan biaknak Biakinn pi cu. Kan ulhmi ni pawl a cemter, Sabbath ni le ni thianghlim pawl cu. Siangpahrang le puithiam pawl khal in an tuar, Tuar harzetmi a thinhennak cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa in a biakṭheng a hnong zo, A Biakinn thianghlim hman a tlansan. Ral pawl a balsiatter ṭheh, Biakinn phar pawl cu. An ral nehnak an aupi ciamco, Lungawi in Pathian kan rak biaknak hmun ahcun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in siatter dingah a tum hrimhrim, Zion kulhnak phar pawl cu. A hlan in a rak tah cia ṭheh zo, Siat ṭheh dingah a ui hrimhrim lo. Hmunkhatah hnawmpen ah an cang ṭheh zo; Donhleisang inn pawl le a phar pawl cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kotka pawl hnawmpen sungah an pil ṭheh; A kothrolh pawl tla an kiak ṭheh. Salkaihmi thawng thlaknak ah an thleng ṭheh, Siangpahrang le bawi upa pawl cu. Daan cu zohman in an zirh nawn lo; Bawipa hnen in langnak an ngah nawn lo, profet pawl cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem patar pawl cu, Leilung ah dai zirziar in an to. An lu ah vutcam an phulh aw, An ruangpi ah buri puan an khuh aw. Jerusalem fala pawl cu, Lei dai in an lu an kun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ṭahnak ah ka mit a kham ṭheh, Ka donhar ah ka thin a pit ṭheh; Ka riahsia in ka tha a celh ṭheh, Ka minung pawl vanduainak an ton ruangah. Nauhak le naute pawl khawpi lamzin ih an sawn an rilh ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tihal le rilrawng in, An nu le pawl an ṭah. Lamzin parah cun an ril, Ral hmapu bangin. Nuamtete in an nunnak a cem, An nule pawl ih ṭaang parah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw duhnungza Jerusalem, Ziang so ka ṭong nawn ding? Ziangtizawng in so ka lo hneem thei ding? Nang vekih a tuartu hi an um keel lo. Na hma hi tipithuanthum tluk in a thuk; Zoso a lo damter thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na profet pawl in lo sim ding an nei lo, thuphanper dah ti lo cu! An thusimmi in an lo bum, Na sualnak an phuang dah fawn si lo! Thudik lo an lo sim ruangah, Sirawknak ṭul lo ah na ruat-aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na kiangih a fehtu pawl in, Hmuhsuam nautatnak thawn an lo zoh. An lu an thing ih an lo hnihsan, Jerusalem siatralnak cu. “Hihi maw khawpi mawi bik an timi cu? Leilung pumpi ih hmaihngalpimi cu hihi maw a si?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na ral pawl in an lo nautat, Huatnak mit thawn an lo zoh. An hmur ciip in an lo hnihsan, “Kan siatsuah ṭheh zo, Kan hngakhlapmi ni cu hihi a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa in a tisuak ngaingai zo, Ka tuah ding a rak ti ringring vekin. Zaangfahnak nei loin in tisiat ṭheh zo, Ralrinnak in rak pek cia vekin. Nehnak a pek hai, kan ral pawl hnenah; Lungawinak a pek hai, kan siatral ṭheh ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Maw Jerusalem, Bawipa hnenah, Nangmah kulhnak phardawl rori hi au hai seh. Na mitthli cu sun zan in, Tiva bangin luang hai seh. Na hrangah colh ni um hlah seh, Na mitthli khal hul ni nei hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zanvarte tho cingcing awla, Bawipa cu ko cingcing aw. Bawipa ih hmaiah na thinlung natnak cu tidai bangin luangter aw. Na faate pawl hrangah baan pharh in zaangfahnak dil aw; Lamzin kel kipih a thi zikmi na faate pawl, Rawl loih a thi ṭheh zikmi na faate pawl hrangah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , zohhnik, Na hrem reromi pawl hi zohhnik. Nunau pawl in an faate sa an ei, An duhdawtmi an faate pawl cu! Puithiam le profet pawl an that, Biakinn pi sung rori ahcun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mino mitar ti loin an thi, Khawpi lamzin ahcun. Fala le tlangval khal an thi, Ral pawl ih ralnam cun. Zaangfahnak nei loin na that hai, Na thinheng ni ahcun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka ral pawl cu khuazakip in na sawm, puai zawh ding bangin. Zohman a luat theitu an um lo, Na thinheng ni ahcun. Ka faate pawl an that ṭheh, Ka duhdawtmi le ka cawmmi pawl cu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian ih hremnak a harzia, A thinhengnak fungfek, A theitu ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tleunak um lo khawthim sungah, Pil deuhdeuh in i tuul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zaangfahnak zianghman um loin, Sunvu cat loin i vuak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka vun a thlek ih ka tit a lang, Ka ruh pawl khal a khiak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A pit zetmi thawnginn ah i khum, Vansan thinharnak thawng sungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka duh lo cing in i umter, Thihnak khawthim rimsia lakah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thir cikcin in i khit, Luat dingah ruahsannak nei lo thawngtla ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian hnen bomnak dilin ka au, Asinain ka aunak a ngai duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sawn phah rero in ka feh, Ka hernak kipah lungphar in i kham.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Savom bangin i bawh, Kiosa vekin i zon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lamzin ihsin i dawihlo, I bauhthlek ṭheh ih i tlansan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A li a nawp ih, A conkiang hmui bahmi ah i tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A conkiang in i sai ih, Ka lung sungah thukpi a lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Miphun pawl in sunvu in hnihsan, An hrangah cun hnihsuahsainak zokzeetnak hla meen ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka duh lo cingin tikha i inter ih, A khami tuarnak cu rawl bangin i eiter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka hmai cu leilung ah i rawt ih, Lungto ah ka ha a khiak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hnangam daihnak in in tlansan, Lungawinak cu ziangvek a si tihman ka ciing nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Reipi ka nung nawn lo ding, Bawipa hnenih ka ruahsannak a cem zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Inn le lo nei loih ka tuar rero hi ka ruah tikah ka hrangah a khami thih sii a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cumi catbaang loin ka ruat ih Ka thin a nau cuahco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Asinain ruahsannak a ra tlungsal, Hi thil pakhat ka theih tikah cun:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A hmunmi Bawipa ih duhdawtnak cu Ziangtik hmanah a cat dah lo; A zaangfahnak cu net ni a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zinglam khawvang bangin a thar ringring; Rintlak a sinak cu a nasa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka covo cu Bawipa lawng a si; Curuangah ka ruahsannak a hnenah ka re ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipa cu a ṭha a si, Amah a ringtu pawl hrangah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thinsau zetin hngah cu kan hrangah a ṭha bik, Amah ih in runnak hngah cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cuih thinsaunak zir cu No lai caan ah a ṭha bik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Harsatnak kan tuar tikah, Thinsau le daizirziar in to ding kan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tangdornak thawn lukuun ding kan si; Ziangahtile ruahsannak a um hrih thei meen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hmuhsuammi le vuakmi kan si hmanah, tuar cuahco ṭheh ding kan si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bawipa cu mi zaangfahtu a si, Kumkhua cun in hnong lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Riahsiatnak in pe hmansehla, A lainatnak cu a lang ding; In duhdawtnak cu rintlak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lungawinak zianghman a nei lo, Kan ninghannak le kan tuarnak ah hin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bawipa in a thei ṭheh, Thawnginn ah leilung ih palcih kan si tikah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amah in a thei ṭheh, Amah ih pekmi covo kan ngah lo tikah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amah in a thei ṭheh, Thuṭhennak hmun ih thudik an dinpi lo tikah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bawipa ih tumtahnak tel loin, Zianghman tuahsuak a si dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cungnungbik thupekmi vekin, a ṭha le a sia an cang fingfing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ziangah so minung an phunzai rero, An sual ruangih hremmi an si tikah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kan nuncan hi zohhliah sal uhsila Bawipa hnenah kirsal uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Vancung Pathian hnenah kan kut lawng si loin kan thinlung khal hlan uhsi. Cule hiti in thlacam uhsi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Na hmai ah kan sual ih kan lo dodal zo; Cule, Maw Bawipa , nang in in ngaithiam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na thinhengnak in na thuam aw; Zaangfahnak zianghman nei loin in dawi ih in that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Na ai-thawhnak khawdur cu Kan thlacamnak in a pah tlang thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nangmah in fihnung hnawmhne ah in tuah, Leilung pumpi miphun hmaiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Kan ral pawl hmuahhmuah in hmuhsuam nautatnak ṭongkam thawn in roh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Siatsuahnak le hlohralnak kan tong zo; Thinphannak le ṭihnunnak sungah kan um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ka minung pawl siatralnak an ton ruangah ka mitthli cu tiva bangin a luang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Ka mitthli cu cerhti bangin Cat loin a puut ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Bawipa in vancung ihsin, I run zoh ih i hmuh hlan lo a cat dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ka riah a sia ih ka thin a na, Khawpi sung nunau pawl parih Thil a thlengmi ruangah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />“Vate bangin thang in in awk, Thuhla um lo ih i huatu ka ral pawl cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ka nungcingin khur sungah in thlak, Lungto in an khuh a kaa ahcun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tidai in i khum cuahco, Ka thi cing ding a sihi, ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />“Khur sung tawdeng ihsin, Maw Bawipa , nangmah ka lo ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ka aunak ngai dingih ka lo dil tikah i theihsak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Ka aunak aw cu i let ih, ‘ṭih hlah aw,’ i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />“Keimah ṭan dingah na ra ih, Maw Bawipa , ka nunnak cu na run ngah zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ka thu cu felzetin i ṭhensak aw; Ka parih an dik lo zia cu na thei ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ka ral pawl in in mitkem zia le In phiar zia cu na thei ṭheh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />“Maw Bawipa , in hmuhsuamnak le In phiarnak hmuahhmuah na thei ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Sun ni-hlawh ka thu lawng an rel ih Keimah zuarthlainak lawng an ngaih tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />An to ah siseh an din ah siseh in puahcok ih Hnihsuahsainak ah in hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />“Maw Bawipa , hiti an tuah ruangah hin cawh awla hrem hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Siatserh hai awla thinlung harnak in khat hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Na thinheng in hawlsuak hai awla, Leilung par ihsin hloralter ṭheh aw.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tle zohzo mi kan sui pawl cu An dal ṭheh zo. Biakinn ih lungto pawl cu lamzin ah ṭhekdarh ṭheh an si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kan hrangah Zion tlangval pawl cu Sui tlukin an rak sunglawi. Sikhalsehla atu ahcun tlakbeel tluk men ah ruah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cinghnia pinu hman in a faate cu ṭhatein zoh a thiam. Asinain ka minung pawl cu nelrawn kalauk vate vek an si; Zaangfahnak zianghman an thiam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka minung in an fano an thihter, Rawl lo le ti loin. Nauhak in rawl an dil naón, Zohman in an pe lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lamzin ah rawl loin an thi, Rawl thawbik a rak eitu pawl cu. Hnawmhne hlonnak ah rawl an hawl, Nunnuam zetih rak cawmmi pawl cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka minung pawl in cawhkuan hremnak an tuar. An tuarnak cu a luar sawn; Milai kut tel loin rin loih a siatmi Sodom khuami pawl hnakin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem lal pawl cu borhhlawh loin vur vekin an thiang; Cawhnawi bangin an raang. An harhdam ih an cakzet; Mepian lungvar bangin an mawi ih an naal zenzen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atu ahcun lamzin ah an thi, Rapṭing hnakin an dum sawn; Zohman in an thei thiam nawn lo. An vun cu an ruh ah a erh aw ṭheh, Thingro vekin an caar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ral kut in a thimi kha an van nei sawn; Neta ih a thimi pawl hnak cun. Ei ding zianghman nei loin, Rawl loih nuamte ih thih cu a har sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuksumza ngaingai a si, Ka minung hnenih a thlengmi vanduainak cu; Lainatu nule pawl in rawl ai ah an suan hai, An sungsuak an faate pawl cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in a ai thawhnak cu, Meivam bangin a run burh. Zion ah meisa a alhter ih, A hramṭohnak tiang ciam ṭheh ko in a kang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zohman in an zum thei lo, Ramdang uktu bawi khal in an zum thei lo; Jerusalem khawpi sung luh thei ding cu; Jerusalem kotka sungih ral pawl luh thei ding cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain an lut thei, A profet le a puithiam pawl an sual ruangah. A profet le a puithiam pawl in thil poimawh an tuah, Mawh nei lomi ih thisen an luanter ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An hotu pawl cu an vakvai, Lamzin tluan ah mitcaw bangin. Thisen an hnih awknak a luar tuk, Zohman ih tham ṭha lo an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Misenpi pawl in, “Tlan uh, Mi borhhlawh nan si, In dai hlah uh,” an ti. Curuangah ram kip ah an vakvai, Khui hmanah tlun inn an tong lo; “Hinah nan um thei lo” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa in an hrangah helhkamnak zianghman a nei lo; A ṭhekdarh sawn hai a si. Kan puithiam le kan upa pawl cu Zianghman ah a siar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bomnak a ra hmang ding ti zoh na ah kan mit a kham ṭheh; Bomnak cu a ra dah si lo. Bomnak in pe hmang ding tiah kan hngak rero naón, Khui ram hman in bomnak in pe thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kan ral pawl in in thlingthla, Kan dung in in thlun ringring; Lamzin hmanah kan vak ngam lo. Tikcu le caan kan nei nawn lo, Kan cem netnak ni a thleng zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Van ih khaupi hnakin, Zamrang sawn in kan ral in in dawi. Tlangpar ah in dawi ih, Nelrawn ah rinlopi in in man.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan nunnak hrampi an kai ngah, Bawipa ih hriakculhmi kan rinsan bikmi cu. In dotu pawl kut ihsin in hum ding; A thla thuai ah kan um ding, kan timi cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hni rero uh, Edom le Uz mipawl, Nan lung awi ko uh, tikcu nan neih sungah cun. Nan siatralnak tikcu a ra thleng ve ko ding; Taklawng le ningzak in nan sawn nan ril rero ve ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zion in a sualman cu a kuan ṭheh zo; Bawipa in saltaannak ah in re nawn lo ding. Sikhalsehla Edom, nang cu Bawipa in a lo hrem ding; Na mawhnak hmuahhmuah a langter ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , kan parih a thleng mi hi in theihsak hram aw. In run zoh awla kan ningzahnak hi in run hmuhsak hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kan ram le kan ro neihmi pawl cu Kan theih dah lomi pawl ih kut sung an thleng. Kan inn pawl cu ramdangmi pawl ih ta ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan pale pawl ral kut in an thi, Ngakṭah farah ah kan cang. Kan nule pawl nuhmei ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan inmi tidai kan lei a ṭul; Kan tihmi zanthing khal a man kan pek a ṭul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan hngawng ah hngawngkol in thlaih; Ramsa bangin cat lo ih dawimi kan si. Kan bang nasa zet naón colh ni kan nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rawl khopkham ih ngah duh ah, Izipt ram le Assiria ram ah rawl dil ah kan feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kan pupa pawl cu an sual ih an um nawn lo; Asinain an sual man cu kannih in kan tuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sal hnakin a ṭha cuang lomi pawl, Kan tlun ah lal an cang. An kut sung ihsin in suah theitu Zohman an um fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi thah hmang pawl hramlak ah an vak rero; Thih ṭih cingin nun duh ah rawl kan hawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan rilrawnnak in kan taksa a satter thluh; Kan vun cu lungthu bangin a ling.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kan nupi pawl an kaihrem, Zion tlang rori ahcun. Judah khawte kipah kan fanu pawl Sualpinak an tuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In hotu pawl an hruai ih, An hngawng in an awk that. Kan patar pawl khal zianghman hmaizahnak an pe lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kan tlangval pawl sal bangin Fang an rialter; Kan nauhak tualleng pawl cu an sawn rero, An phurhmi zanthing a rit tuk ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan patar pawl in an tlansan zo, An to ṭheunak khawpi kotka cu. Tlangval khal in an tlansan zo, An tum ṭheumi ṭingṭang pawl cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan nunnak sung ihsin Lungawinak a suakhlo zo. Kan nomnak le kan laamnak cu, Riahsiatnak in a airawl zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan suilukhuh kan lu ihsin a tla zo. Kan sual zo ih kan lamzin a pit a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi ruangah kan thin a na, Kan thin muril tiangin a na. Hi bangtuk ruangah hin Kan mit a mal thlang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ziangahtile Zion tlang cu a ṭhing, ṭio sanmi hmun a si; Hramlak ih cinghnia pawl an vak, Siatbalmi khawrop ahcun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asinain, maw Bawipa , nang cu Kumkhua in uktu bawi na si. Na bawi tokham cu san ih-khuk in a hmun ringring ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ziangah so atu tiang, In dungtun ringring hrih? Ziangtik talah in thei sal nawn pei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na hnenah in kirter hram aw, Maw Bawipa , in kirter hram aw. Khuahlan kan rak sunlawinak pawl cu In pe kir sal hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Culole kannih hi kumkhua in maw in hnong ding? Kan parih na thinhengnak hi Cem ni a nei lo ding maw si?
  </para>
</usx>
